---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Начало">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative bg-orange-50 overflow-hidden" style="isolation: isolate; contain: paint;">
        <!-- Ghost Dog -->
        <div
            class="absolute -right-24 sm:-right-32 md:-right-56 -bottom-16 sm:-bottom-24 md:-bottom-40 w-[300px] h-[300px] sm:w-[400px] sm:h-[400px] md:w-[600px] md:h-[600px] pointer-events-none reveal reveal-left delay-300"
        >
            <img
                src="/bg-dog-transparent.png"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-full object-contain object-bottom opacity-30 md:opacity-50 transition-opacity duration-1000 ease-in-out"
                style="opacity: 0; transform: translateZ(0); backface-visibility: hidden; will-change: auto;"
                onload="this.style.opacity = '';"
                loading="eager"
            />
        </div>

        <div
            class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 lg:py-32 flex flex-col items-center text-center"
        >
            <h1
                class="reveal reveal-up delay-100 text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6"
            >
                Даваме <span class="text-orange-700">надежда</span> на бездомните
                животни
            </h1>
            <p
                class="reveal reveal-up delay-200 text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10"
            >
                Ние сме неправителствена организация, посветена на спасяването,
                лечението и намирането на любящи домове за животни в нужда в
                град Варна, България <span class="text-xl leading-none">🇧🇬</span> и региона.
            </p>
            <div
                class="reveal reveal-up delay-300 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4"
            >
                <a
                    href="/donate"
                    class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-3 border border-transparent text-base font-bold rounded-md text-white bg-orange-700 hover:bg-orange-800 transition-colors shadow-sm"
                >
                    Как да помогна
                </a>
                <a
                    href="/adopt"
                    class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-3 border border-slate-300 text-base font-bold rounded-md text-slate-700 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"
                >
                    Осинови приятел
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Us & Mission -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                <div class="reveal reveal-left delay-100">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">
                        Нашата мисия
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        Анимал Хоуп Варна е организация с нестопанска цел, която
                        се стреми да повиши осведомеността срещу жестокостта към
                        животните и да предостави помощ на бездомните животни в
                        град Варна. Ние сме екип от 100% доброволци, обединени
                        от желанието да създадем живот без болка за тези, които
                        нямат глас.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                        Не получаваме държавна помощ и се издържаме изцяло от
                        дарения. Всяко спасено животно е доказателство за силата
                        на нашата общност и вашата подкрепа.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="reveal reveal-right delay-200 relative">
                    <div
                        class="aspect-w-16 aspect-h-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl"
                    >
                        <img
                            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543466835-00a7907e9de1?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1200"
                            alt="Доброволец прегръща спасено куче"
                            class="object-cover w-full h-full"
                        />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Core Activities -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal reveal-up">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">
                    Какво правим
                </h2>
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
                    Работим неуморно за осъществяването на нашата мечта чрез
                    комплексна грижа за животните.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
                <!-- Vet Care -->
                <div
                    class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300 reveal reveal-up delay-100 group"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-14 h-14 bg-orange-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                    >
                        <svg
                            class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-600"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"
                            ></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                        Ветеринарна помощ
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600">
                        Осигуряваме спешно лечение, животоспасяващи процедури и
                        грижа за ранени и болни животни в нашите партньорски
                        клиники.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Preventative Care -->
                <div
                    class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300 reveal reveal-up delay-200 group"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                    >
                        <svg
                            class="w-8 h-8 text-blue-600"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"
                            ></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                        Превенция
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600">
                        Грижим се за чипиране, кастриране, ваксиниране и
                        обезпаразитяване, за да осигурим здрав и сигурен живот.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Fostering -->
                <div
                    class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300 reveal reveal-up delay-300 group"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                    >
                        <svg
                            class="w-8 h-8 text-teal-600"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"
                            ></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                        Временни домове
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600">
                        Намираме приемни домове за животните, за да могат да се
                        възстановят и социализират в домашна среда.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Forever Homes -->
                <div
                    class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300 reveal reveal-up delay-400 group"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-14 h-14 bg-purple-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                    >
                        <svg
                            class="w-8 h-8 text-purple-600"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"
                            ></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                        Нов живот
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600">
                        Вярваме, че всяко животно заслужава шанс и нашата крайна
                        цел е да намерим отговорни стопани и вечен дом.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Adoption Process & International Reach -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse gap-12 items-center">
                <div class="lg:w-1/2 reveal reveal-right delay-100">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">
                        Осиновяване и нов дом
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        Търсим отговорни осиновители предимно в България, но с
                        помощта на наши доброволци от други страни, животинките
                        ни намират домове също и в чужбина.
                    </p>
                    <div
                        class="bg-orange-50 border-l-4 border-orange-500 p-6 rounded-r-lg mb-6"
                    >
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-orange-800 mb-2">
                            Нашите изисквания
                        </h4>
                        <p class="text-orange-700">
                            Изискваме от всички потенциални осиновители да
                            попълнят въпросник и да подпишат договор. Така
                            гарантираме най-доброто място за нашите изстрадали
                            бездомничета и предотвратяваме завръщането им на
                            улицата.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 italic text-sm">
                        * Животните ни се дават само за домашни любимци, които
                        ще бъдат третирани като членове на семейството, а не за
                        пазачи на синджир или мишеловки.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="lg:w-1/2 reveal reveal-left delay-200">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <img
                            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583337130417-3346a1be7dee?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600"
                            alt="Щастливо осиновено куче"
                            class="rounded-2xl shadow-lg object-cover h-48 sm:h-64 w-full transform translate-y-4"
                        />
                        <img
                            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495360010541-f48722b34f7d?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600"
                            alt="Спокойна котка в нов дом"
                            class="rounded-2xl shadow-lg object-cover h-48 sm:h-64 w-full transform -translate-y-4"
                        />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Impact Section -->
    <section class="relative py-20 bg-slate-900 overflow-hidden text-white">
        <!-- Ghost Cat -->
        <div
            class="reveal reveal-right delay-300 absolute left-0 md:-left-32 bottom-0 w-[250px] h-[250px] sm:w-[350px] sm:h-[350px] md:w-[500px] md:h-[500px] pointer-events-none opacity-20 z-0"
        >
            <div
                class="w-full h-full bg-no-repeat bg-contain bg-bottom"
                style="background-image: url('/bg-cat-transparent.png')"
            >
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div
                class="text-center mb-16 reveal reveal-up relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto"
            >
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">
                    Какво постигнахме заедно през годините?
                </h2>
                <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-300">
                    Това са приблизителни статистики от началото на историята на
                    приюта. Благодарение на вашата подкрепа, ние продължаваме да
                    променяме животи всеки ден.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div
                class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center relative z-10"
            >
                <div
                    class="p-8 bg-slate-800/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 reveal reveal-up delay-100 hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors shadow-xl"
                >
                    <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-orange-500 mb-3">
                        1460<span class="text-white">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-slate-200 font-medium text-lg">
                        Спасени живота
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="p-8 bg-slate-800/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 reveal reveal-up delay-200 hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors shadow-xl"
                >
                    <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-orange-500 mb-3">
                        1294<span class="text-white">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-slate-200 font-medium text-lg">
                        Намерили своя дом
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="p-8 bg-slate-800/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 reveal reveal-up delay-300 hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors shadow-xl"
                >
                    <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-orange-500 mb-3">
                        2073<span class="text-white">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-slate-200 font-medium text-lg">
                        Успешни кастрации
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="p-8 bg-slate-800/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 reveal reveal-up delay-400 hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors shadow-xl"
                >
                    <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-orange-500 mb-3">
                        150<span class="text-white">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-slate-200 font-medium text-lg">
                        Очакват своето семейство
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How You Can Help -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-orange-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal reveal-up">
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">
                    Всеки може да помогне
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                    Работата ни е безкрайна, а ние сме малко. Имаме нужда от вашата
                    подкрепа. Не е нужно да живеете в България – имаме доброволци,
                    които ни помагат дистанционно.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-12 lg:gap-16 mb-16">
                <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 reveal reveal-left delay-100">
                    <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl aspect-video lg:aspect-square xl:aspect-[4/3]">
                        <img 
                            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548199973-03cce0bbc87b?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800" 
                            alt="Доброволец си играе с кучета" 
                            class="object-cover w-full h-full"
                        />
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-black/20 to-transparent flex items-end p-8">
                            <h3 class="text-white text-2xl font-bold">Твоята помощ променя животи</h3>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 reveal reveal-right delay-200">
                    <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-6 font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-center lg:text-left">
                        Можете да помогнете като:
                    </p>
                    
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <!-- Card 1 -->
                        <a href="/adopt" class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl border border-orange-100 hover:border-orange-500 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col items-center text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-orange-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-orange-500 transition-all duration-300">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition-colors">Осиновите</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-2">Отворете дома и сърцето си за нов член на семейството.</p>
                        </a>
                        
                        <!-- Card 2 -->
                        <a href="/foster" class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl border border-teal-100 hover:border-teal-500 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col items-center text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-teal-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-teal-500 transition-all duration-300">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-teal-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-teal-700 transition-colors">Приютите</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-2">Станете приемен дом и дайте време на животно да се възстанови.</p>
                        </a>

                        <!-- Card 3 -->
                        <a href="/donate" class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl border border-blue-100 hover:border-blue-500 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col items-center text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-500 transition-all duration-300">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors">Дарите</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-2">Подкрепете ни финансово или с храна и консумативи.</p>
                        </a>

                        <!-- Card 4 -->
                        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl border border-purple-100 hover:border-purple-500 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col items-center text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left cursor-pointer" onclick="window.open('https://facebook.com/animalhope.varna', '_blank')">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-purple-500 transition-all duration-300">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.684 13.342C8.886 12.938 9 12.482 9 12c0-.482-.114-.938-.316-1.342m0 2.684a3 3 0 110-2.684m0 2.684l6.632 3.316m-6.632-6l6.632-3.316m0 0a3 3 0 105.367-2.684 3 3 0 00-5.367 2.684zm0 9.316a3 3 0 105.368 2.684 3 3 0 00-5.368-2.684z"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-purple-700 transition-colors">Споделите</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-2">Споделете нашите публикации и помогнете да достигнем до повече хора.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div
                class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl shadow-lg text-left reveal reveal-up delay-300 border-l-4 border-orange-500 relative overflow-hidden"
            >
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mt-8 -mr-8 w-32 h-32 bg-orange-50 rounded-full opacity-50 pointer-events-none"></div>
